.TH ORVANTA-CONTROL-CENTER 1 "November 2026" "ORVANTA OS 0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
orvanta-control-center \- ORVANTA graphical system overview
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B orvanta-control-center
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B orvanta-control-center
is a read-only Qt dashboard that shows the distribution name, hostname,
load average, memory use, root filesystem use and uptime of the local system,
and whether the nftables firewall and remote-access services (Cockpit, Samba,
SSH) are running, as reported by
.BR systemctl (1).
It does not change system state and must not be run as root.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR os-release (5),
.BR systemctl (1)
